# Flies on the wall (terminal slice)

Curve-mode chase with three modes, driven by `Wall::step` arguments:
1 = chase, 2 = surprise (all chase a mouse point), 3 = steer (fly 0 is moved
by `udx`/`udy`, the rest chase it). The terminal slice passes mode 1 with no
mouse/keys.

## Schema

```
Wall = [Fly]/flies Int/follow @WCHNTMaths/maths
Fly = Float/x Float/y String/col Bool/live
```

## Construction

```
[:Wall [:Array/Fly] 2 maths]
```

## Methods

```
Fly::move = { Fly/t |
  dx = t.x - x.
  dy = t.y - y.
  adx = if (dx < 0.0) { -dx } else { dx }.
  ady = if (dy < 0.0) { -dy } else { dy }.
  if (not live) {
    [:Fly x y col false]
  } else if ((adx < 2.0) and (ady < 2.0)) {
    [:Fly x y col false]
  } else {
    steps = if (adx > ady) { adx } else { ady }.
    xinc = if (dx == 0.0) { 0.0 } else { dx / steps }.
    yinc = if (dy == 0.0) { 0.0 } else { dy / steps }.
    [:Fly (x + xinc) (y + yinc) col true]
  }
}

Fly::steer = { Float/udx, Float/udy |
  [:Fly (x + udx) (y + udy) col true]
}

Wall::step = { Int/mode, Float/mx, Float/my, Float/udx, Float/udy |
  n = flies.length().
  moved = n.times({ i |
    f = flies.get(i).
    j = ((i + follow + n) % n).
    target = if (mode == 2) {
      [:Fly mx my "white" true]
    } else if (mode == 3) {
      flies.get(0)
    } else {
      flies.get(j)
    }.
    if ((mode == 3) and (i == 0)) {
      f.steer(udx, udy)
    } else {
      f.move(target)
    }
  }).
  [:Wall moved follow maths]
}

Wall::aliveCount = { flies.fold(0, { acc, f | if (f.live) { acc + 1 } else { acc } }) }

Wall::init = {
  cols = [:Array/String "red" "green" "blue" "white"].
  moved = 12.times({ i |
    a = ((2.0 * maths.pi()) * i) / 12.0.
    fx = 400.0 + (maths.cos(a) * 250.0).
    fy = 300.0 + (maths.sin(a) * 250.0).
    c = cols.get(i % 4).
    [:Fly fx fy c true]
  }).
  [:Wall moved follow maths]
}
```

## Target

```
%terminal

%requires
WCHNTMaths::rand() -> Float
WCHNTMaths::randInt(Int) -> Int
WCHNTMaths::sin(Float) -> Float
WCHNTMaths::cos(Float) -> Float
WCHNTMaths::pi() -> Float

%main
public static function main():Void {
    var assemblage = WallAssemblage.factory(wchntMaths).init();
    var helper = new WCHNTHelper();
    trace(assemblage.toConstruction(0, helper));
    for (i in 0...3) {
        assemblage = assemblage.step(1, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0);
        trace(assemblage.toConstruction(0, helper));
    }
}
```
